## Project Structure

```
{{config.name}}/
{{#each config.frontend.apps}}
  apps/{{this.name}}/          # {{this.type}} frontend
{{/each}}
{{#each config.backend.services}}
{{#ifEquals this.type "go"}}
  services/{{this.name}}/      # Go service
{{else}}
  apps/{{this.name}}/          # {{this.type}} backend
{{/ifEquals}}
{{/each}}
  packages/                    # Shared packages
{{#ifEquals config.database.type "postgres"}}
  db/                          # Database schema & migrations
{{/ifEquals}}
  docs/                        # Documentation
    adr/                       # Architecture Decision Records
{{#if config.needsDocker}}
  infra/                       # Infrastructure configs
    docker/                    # Docker compose for local dev
{{/if}}
```

## Getting Started

```bash
# Install dependencies
pnpm install

# Start local services
{{#if config.needsDocker}}
docker compose -f infra/docker/docker-compose.yml up -d
{{/if}}

# Run all apps in dev mode
pnpm dev

# Run tests
pnpm test

# Build everything
pnpm build
```

